codex
The current implementation re-sorts every window (O(n·w log w)) and rebuilds a set per window (O(n·w)). I'll replace both with a two-heap lazy-deletion median (O(n log w)) and a sliding-window Counter (O(n)). Let me grab a baseline timing first.
